{"ref":"BDB, בֶּ֫דֶק","hw":"בֶּ֫דֶק","html":"<big><span dir=\"rtl\">בֶּ֫דֶק</span></big>  <strong>n.m.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"II Kings 12:6\" href=\"/II_Kings.12.6\">2 K 12:6</a></sup> <strong>fissure, rent, breach (</strong>Aramaic <span dir=\"rtl\">בִּידְקָא</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ܒܶܕܩܳܐ</span> (Nasar.)<strong>)</strong>—<span dir=\"rtl\">בּ׳</span> abs. <a data-ref=\"II Kings 12:6\" href=\"/II_Kings.12.6\">2 K 12:6</a>; cstr. <em>ib.</em> + 6 times; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">בִּדְקֵךְ</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 27:9\" href=\"/Ezekiel.27.9\">Ez 27:9</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 27:27\" href=\"/Ezekiel.27.27\">27</a>;—in as building; temple <span dir=\"rtl\">ב׳ הַבַּיִת</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 12:6\" href=\"/II_Kings.12.6\">2 K 12:6</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 12:7\" href=\"/II_Kings.12.7\">7</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 12:8\" href=\"/II_Kings.12.8\">8</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 12:9\" href=\"/II_Kings.12.9\">9</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Kings 22:5\" href=\"/II_Kings.22.5\">22:5</a>, cf. <a data-ref=\"II Kings 12:13\" href=\"/II_Kings.12.13\">12:13</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(ב׳ בֵּית י׳)</span>; v <a data-ref=\"II Kings 12:6\" href=\"/II_Kings.12.6\">6</a> abs.; law. c. <span dir=\"rtl\">חִזֵּק</span> <em>repair;</em> cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">מַחֲזִיקֵי ב׳</span> <em>repairers of thy fissures</em> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 27:9\" href=\"/Ezekiel.27.9\">Ez 27:9</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 27:27\" href=\"/Ezekiel.27.27\">27</a> (of Tyre).","next":"BDB, בָּדַק","prev":"BDB, בדק"}